     - `TitlesAndTextWindow.cs`: Replicates Vegas Pro OFX Titles & Text generator dialog with live timeline preview updates, preset library (`Default`, `Title 01`, `Subtitle`, `Lower Third`, `Banner Title`, `Pop In`), multi-line text editor, typography toggles, 9-point anchor alignment, fill colors, outline, shadow, and background box options.
